# edge-ai-yocto systemd presets.
#
# v0: no masks. Vendor-layer units (v4l2-init, audio-init) from meta-rz-distro
# are suppressed at parse time via BBMASK in kas/base.yml, not here. Future
# tiers can add lines like:
#
#   disable v4l2-init.service
#   disable rpcbind.service
#   disable rpcbind.socket
